cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "MissingPatterns.jl: terminal-based exploration of missing data patterns in Julia"
abstract: >-
  MissingPatterns.jl is a Julia package for exploring missing data patterns in
  any Tables.jl-compatible source. It renders missing-value heatmaps, unique
  missingness patterns, per-column summaries, pairwise co-occurrence of
  missingness and before/after diffs directly in the terminal using Unicode and
  ANSI truecolor, with no plotting-library dependencies, and can export the same
  heatmap as standalone HTML.
type: software
authors:
